Imbues your stone spikes with arcane forces, dealing [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Arcane damage and silencing each target hit for [4, 6, 7, 8, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage increases with Spellpower and the chance to silence increases with either Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.
